00:12:00,929 --> 00:12:02,055
Awak ada bidan?

224
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:05,808
- <i>Doula</i> kelahiran?
- Tak, saya tak memerlukannya.

225
00:12:06,267 --> 00:12:09,061
Wanita lahirkan anak sendiri
selama ribuan tahun.

226
00:12:09,062 --> 00:12:12,649
Ya, kadar kematian bayi sebanyak
30% selama hampir ribuan tahun.

227
00:12:13,066 --> 00:12:14,650
Panjang femur, 7cm.

228
00:12:14,651 --> 00:12:16,903
37 minggu. Mungkin akan induksi.

229
00:12:17,528 --> 00:12:20,864
Apa? Tak nak. Tak boleh!

230
00:12:20,865 --> 00:12:24,326
Pada minggu ke-37, rawatan
praeklampsia adalah lahirkan bayi.

231
00:12:24,327 --> 00:12:27,162
Awak perlu dibawa ke atas
untuk mendorong proses bersalin

232
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:29,289
- untuk selamatkan awak berdua.
- Tak.

233
00:12:29,290 --> 00:12:30,500
Tak boleh.

234
00:12:33,962 --> 00:12:35,796
Ya, itu pasti Jasper.

235
00:12:35,797 --> 00:12:38,173
Dia masih hidup
ketika syif saya tamat pagi tadi.

236
00:12:38,174 --> 00:12:39,883
Dia pesakit syif siang.

237
00:12:39,884 --> 00:12:42,470
Tak lagi.
Dia mayat untuk kita tangani.

238
00:12:45,056 --> 00:12:46,181
Dia dah mati?

239
00:12:46,182 --> 00:12:47,432
- Tak.
- Tak.

240
00:12:47,433 --> 00:12:50,727
Okey, En. Reed. Kami akan periksa
awak di dalam, okey?

241
00:12:50,728 --> 00:12:52,312
- Dia macam mati.
- Awak doktor?

242
00:12:52,313 --> 00:12:54,731
- Tak, tapi dia...
- Menghidap hipernarkolepsi.

243
00:12:54,732 --> 00:12:55,817
Perkara serius.

244
00:12:56,818 --> 00:12:57,902
Maafkan saya.

245
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,822
Kadangkala benci syif malam.

246
00:13:12,959 --> 00:13:14,126
Wah!

247
00:13:14,127 --> 00:13:17,004
