248
00:13:17,005 --> 00:13:18,214
Awak...

249
00:13:19,299 --> 00:13:21,301
- Awak nampak Robby?
- Tak.

250
00:13:22,427 --> 00:13:25,429
Dah siapkan carta dari awal syif?

251
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:27,472
- Ya.
- Kenapa belum balik?

252
00:13:27,473 --> 00:13:28,808
Saya cuma...

253
00:13:29,225 --> 00:13:32,520
- Awak nak tengok bunga api?
- Ya.

254
00:13:33,062 --> 00:13:35,023
Saya patut tengok bersama Becca,

255
00:13:35,982 --> 00:13:39,986
tapi dia berada di rumah
keluarga Adam, teman lelakinya.

256
00:13:44,657 --> 00:13:47,243
Hidup adik awak nampaknya...

257
00:13:48,786 --> 00:13:50,079
cukup tersusun.

258
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:52,123
Ya.

259
00:13:53,166 --> 00:13:54,542
Lebih daripada saya sedari.

260
00:13:56,836 --> 00:13:57,920
Bagaimana hari awak?

261
00:14:00,173 --> 00:14:01,174
Ada yang lebih baik.

262
00:14:02,675 --> 00:14:03,760
Awak?

263
00:14:06,637 --> 00:14:07,722
Ya.

264
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:11,351
Tapi ada yang jauh lebih teruk.

265
00:14:12,435 --> 00:14:14,853
Saya buat
pembetulan serviks tertutup.

266
00:14:14,854 --> 00:14:17,106
Saya ada dengar. Pasti sangat hebat.

267
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:20,276
Tangan masih menggigil.

268
00:14:20,985 --> 00:14:24,072
Hei, awak boleh ajar saya nanti?

269
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,157
- Ya.
- Ya?

270
00:14:27,158 --> 00:14:29,451
Ya. Cuma harap awak
tak perlu gunakannya.

271
00:14:29,452 --> 00:14:33,039
- Pesakit boleh jadi lumpuh.
- Ya, tapi tak gagal.

272
00:14:34,415 --> 00:14:36,292
Ya, saya tak gagal.

273
00:14:37,585 --> 00:14:38,669
Terima kasih...

274
00:14:39,962 --> 00:14:41,005
sebab redakan saya

275
00:14:42,048 --> 00:14:43,466
tadi.

276
00:14:44,842 --> 00:14:46,010
Maaf saya marah.

277
00:14:48,221 --> 00:14:49,305
Tak apa.

278
00:14:57,563 --> 00:15:00,315
Dr. Mohan, awak tahu
pengangkatan antara saudara?

279
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:03,110
Jururawat atau doktor
boleh jadi penjaga kecemasan...

280
00:15:03,111 --> 00:15:06,572
Tak, saya tak perlukan anak.
Saya perlu cari kerja dulu.

281
00:15:07,198 --> 00:15:09,574
Candice O'Grady,
wanita berusia 82 tahun

282
00:15:09,575 --> 00:15:11,994
