kerana muntah.

283
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:15,289
- Tak demam, gigil atau sakit perut.
- Penilaian...

284
00:15:19,043 --> 00:15:21,503
Saya dah ada anak
dan hampir tak terdaya.

285
00:15:21,504 --> 00:15:23,463
Bagaimana dengan yang tidur ini?

286
00:15:23,464 --> 00:15:24,882
Dia jaga Whitaker.

287
00:15:25,633 --> 00:15:28,552
Kalau tahu sesiapa
boleh jaga bayi Jane Doe,

288
00:15:28,553 --> 00:15:30,346
- beritahu kaunter utama.
- Ya.

289
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:34,142
Saya nak jaga, tapi Benji akan marah.

290
00:15:36,394 --> 00:15:38,895
- Tekanan darah, 164/114.
- 40 labetalol.

291
00:15:38,896 --> 00:15:41,565
Magnesium diberi.
IV sebanyak 2g sejam.

292
00:15:41,566 --> 00:15:45,318
Ini keputusannya.
Hemoglobin 7.5, platelet 40.

293
00:15:45,319 --> 00:15:46,571
LFT sangat tinggi.

294
00:15:47,029 --> 00:15:48,196
Sindrom HELLP.

295
00:15:48,197 --> 00:15:51,283
Anemia hemolitik, enzim hati tinggi
dan platelet rendah.

296
00:15:51,284 --> 00:15:53,995
Bilik sedang dikemas.
Kita gerak dalam 10 minit.

297
00:15:54,537 --> 00:15:55,705
Awak okey, Judith?

298
00:15:57,874 --> 00:15:59,876
Saya...

299
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:03,129
- Dia sawan.
- Tak guna.

300
00:16:03,754 --> 00:16:06,089
Beri 10 diazepam IV.
Sediakan 10 lagi.

301
00:16:06,090 --> 00:16:08,258
Kita tak dapat dengar
degupan jantung janin.

302
00:16:08,259 --> 00:16:10,719
Pakai topeng oksigen, 15 liter.
Nak intubasi?

303
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,596
Belum. Cuba hentikan sawan.

304
00:16:12,597 --> 00:16:15,433
Elak samarkan sawan
dengan kelumpuhan kecuali terpaksa.

305
00:16:16,142 --> 00:16:17,226
Okey.

306
00:16:20,563 --> 00:16:22,939
Crus, CTG tak dapat dibaca,
guna ultrabunyi.

307
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:24,817
- Baik.
- Nazely, diagnosisnya?

308
00:16:25,693 --> 00:16:27,820
Kehadiran sawan
mengesahkan eklampsia.

309
00:16:29,155 --> 00:16:31,198
- Jantung janin, 90.
- Terlalu rendah.

310
00:16:31,199 --> 00:16:33,451
- Saturasi berkurangan.
- Intubasi?

311
00:16:33,826 --> 00:16:35,244
Bersedia, tapi tunggu.

312
00:16:35,745 --> 00:16:36,912
Tambah 10mg diazepam.

313
00:16:36,913 --> 00:16:38,456
Beri 4g Keppra.

314
00:16:42,418 --> 00:16:45,045
...sejarah hipertensi,
datang jabatan kecemasan

315
00:16:45,046 --> 00:16:46,881
dengan aduan utama pening,

316
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:49,424
selepas tak sengaja telan 80mg...

317
00:16:49,425 --> 00:16:50,842
Kamu semua bagaimana?

318
00:16:50,843 --> 00:16:53,720
- Hampir selesai.
- Nampak Dr. Al-Hashimi?

319
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:55,473
- Tak.
- Bolehkah kita cakap sekejap?

320
00:17:00,937 --> 00:17:03,897
Saya nak cakap,
saya dah tonton hantaran awak...

321
00:17:03,898 --> 00:17:05,815
Saya cuba sampaikan
mesej kesihatan...

322
00:17:05,816 --> 00:17:07,193
Saya rasa ia hebat.

323
00:17:08,027 --> 00:17:09,111
Sangat bagus.

324
00:17:09,737 --> 00:17:10,738
Betul?

325
00:17:10,863 --> 00:17:12,740
Ya.

326
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:15,076
- Teruskan.
- Okey.

327
00:17:15,826 --> 00:17:17,286
Selagi patuh HIPAA.

328
00:17:18,496 --> 00:17:20,665
- Memang pun.
- Buat selepas siap carta.

329
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:22,542
Dah tentu.

330
00:17:24,877 --> 00:17:26,254
Sebenarnya, Dr. Robby, maaf.

331
00:17:27,672 --> 00:17:29,799
- Boleh saya tanya?
- Silakan.

332
00:17:30,758 --> 00:17:34,512
Saya sedang timbangkan
pengkhususan psikiatri kecemasan.

333
00:17:35,930 --> 00:17:37,139
Sangat hebat.

334
00:17:38,349 --> 00:17:39,725
Awak rasa saya patut teruskan?

335
00:17:42,311 --> 00:17:46,023
Saya rasa awak boleh buat
apa saja awak mahu, Victoria.

336
00:17:50,194 --> 00:17:51,279
Okey.

337
00:17:51,654 --> 00:17:53,197
Oksigen nadi, 88.

338
00:17:54,699 --> 00:17:55,783
Dr. Abbot?

339
00:17:56,576 --> 00:17:58,952
- Intubasi?
- Baiklah.

340
00:17:58,953 --> 00:18:02,122
Nazely, apa cadangan
untuk induksi jujukan pantas?

341
00:18:02,123 --> 00:18:03,249
Etomidat dan roc.

342
00:18:03,833 --> 00:18:05,750
Tak tepat. 120 propofol,

343
00:18:05,751 --> 00:18:07,877
60 suksinilkolina. Kenapa, Crus?

344
00:18:07,878 --> 00:18:09,921
Propofol untuk kesan antisawan,

345
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:12,674
suksinilkolina untuk elak lumpuh
dan periksa saraf.

346
00:18:12,675 --> 00:18:14,843
- Tepat sekali.
- Propofol diberi.

347
00:18:14,844 --> 00:18:16,219
Sebaik sawan reda,

348
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:17,971
kita perlu alihkan uterus ke kiri.

349
00:18:17,972 --> 00:18:20,600
Nazely, pegang, dua tangan.
Alih bayi tindih vena kava.

350
00:18:20,808 --> 00:18:21,891
Sux dah diberi.

351
00:18:21,892 --> 00:18:24,644
Tapi selepas lumpuh,
sawan berhenti, bukan?

352
00:18:24,645 --> 00:18:25,812
Mungkin nampak begitu,

353
00:18:25,813 --> 00:18:28,315
tapi sawan berterusan
masih ganggu otak.

354
00:18:28,316 --> 00:18:30,025
Kita pantau EEG.

355
00:18:30,026 --> 00:18:31,777
- Sempat pantau?
- Tunggu dan lihat.

356
00:18:33,195 --> 00:18:34,321
Sudah lumpuh.

357
00:18:34,322 --> 00:18:35,906
Ayuh, telentangkan.

358
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:40,202
Intubasi, kemudian EEG
untuk lihat jika otak masih sawan.

359
00:18:41,162 --> 00:18:42,662
Awak kena terus berjaya.

360
00:18:42,663 --> 00:18:43,789
Tepat sekali.

361
00:18:52,798 --> 00:18:54,884
- Nampak Dr. Al-Hashimi?
- Tak.

362
00:18:55,384 --> 00:18:56,886
Nampak Dr. Al-Hashimi?

363
00:18:57,803 --> 00:18:58,888
Al-Hashimi?

364
00:18:59,764 --> 00:19:02,307
Dengan keadaan hari ini,
dia mungkin dah berhenti.

365
00:19:02,308 --> 00:19:05,393
Tadi dia dengan bayi Jane Doe.

366
00:19:05,394 --> 00:19:07,021
Saya baru pergi tadi.

367
00:19:07,897 --> 00:19:08,981
Nak saya kelui dia?

368
00:19:09,899 --> 00:19:11,651
Tak apa. Biar saya cari.

369
00:19:16,697 --> 00:19:17,782
Helo?

370
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,870
Hei, macam mana staf kita
semasa deposisi?

371
00:19:23,704 --> 00:19:25,705
Dr. Ellis memang cekal.

372
00:19:25,706 --> 00:19:29,334
Dr. King kena teruk.
Mereka agak kasar dengannya.

373
00:19:29,335 --> 00:19:30,835
- Dia sensitif.
- Sangat.

374
00:19:30,836 --> 00:19:32,420
Malangnya belum berakhir.

375
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:35,007
- Mereka nak panggil dia lagi.
- Teruknya.

376
00:19:35,675 --> 00:19:38,343
Mungkin saya patut ikut awak
untuk beritahu dia.

377
00:19:38,344 --> 00:19:40,261
- Bagus juga.
- Hei, alang-alang.

378
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:42,223
Boleh saya tanya soalan hipotesis?

379
00:19:43,182 --> 00:19:46,643
Jika seorang doktor syak
doktor lain ada masalah perubatan

380
00:19:46,644 --> 00:19:49,270
yang boleh jejaskan
cara mereka merawat pesakit,

381
00:19:49,271 --> 00:19:52,942
pendedahan keadaan itu
melanggar bahagian HIPAA mana?

382
00:19:54,193 --> 00:19:55,945
Pertama, jangan buat mudarat.

383
00:19:58,489 --> 00:20:00,408
Dr. King, ada masa sebentar?

384
00:20:08,332 --> 00:20:10,166
Paru-paru bergerak dua hala.

385
00:20:10,167 --> 00:20:12,128
Jantung janin, sempadan pada 98.

386
00:20:13,754 --> 00:20:15,506
Miringkan ke kiri. Boleh membantu.

387
00:20:16,006 --> 00:20:17,925
Satu, dua, tiga.

388
00:20:18,968 --> 00:20:20,052
Okey.

389
00:20:21,429 --> 00:20:22,512
Semua baik.

390
00:20:22,513 --> 00:20:24,932
- Monitor EEG sedia digunakan.
- Laju.

391
00:20:25,933 --> 00:20:28,477
Masih sawan walau lumpuh.
Status bukan sawan.

392
00:20:29,937 --> 00:20:31,146
Ubat apa dah diberi?

393
00:20:31,147 --> 00:20:34,065
30 diazepam, dos maksimum
magnesium, Keppra dan propofol.

394
00:20:34,066 --> 00:20:36,569
- Aduhai. Langkah seterusnya?
- Ada idea?

395
00:20:37,445 --> 00:20:38,529
Nazely?

396
00:20:39,113 --> 00:20:40,781
Dilantin? Valproat?

397
00:20:41,198 --> 00:20:43,242
Infusi terlalu lama, kesannya pun.

398
00:20:43,826 --> 00:20:47,162
Beri 100 ketamin. Boleh beri
hasil dengan status refraktori.

399
00:20:47,163 --> 00:20:48,788
Dia alami sindrom HELLP.

400
00:20:48,789 --> 00:20:51,249
Hemoglobin hanya 7,
platelet turun kepada 30.

401
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:52,709
Dua unit darah penuh?

402
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:55,004
O negatif sedang diberi ketika ini.

403
00:20:55,421 --> 00:20:57,172
Pasangkan pad AP juga.

404
00:20:57,173 --> 00:21:00,300
Beri 10 IV Decadron
untuk tolak keradangan.

405
00:21:00,301 --> 00:21:02,135
Jantung janin, 104.

406
00:21:02,136 --> 00:21:05,055
- Lebih baik.
- Ya. Dia patut bersama OB.

407
00:21:05,848 --> 00:21:08,768
Ya, selepas kita hentikan sawan ini.

408
00:21:09,602 --> 00:21:12,687
Ada kelewatan pengambilan sejarah

409
00:21:12,688 --> 00:21:15,899
disebabkan peranti
tafsiran VRI tak berfungsi.

410
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:18,610
Dalam tempoh ini, CBC normal

411
00:21:18,611 --> 00:21:21,739
dan panel metabolik komprehensif
kembali dari makmal.

412
00:21:23,449 --> 00:21:25,117
Kenapa kali ini, Malfeasance?

413
00:21:25,618 --> 00:21:27,411
Saya perlu buat satu lagi deposisi.

414
00:21:28,746 --> 00:21:31,582
Kasihannya.
Awak mesti dah buat silap.

415
00:21:33,334 --> 00:21:34,793
Kawan, saya bergurau.

416
00:21:34,794 --> 00:21:37,379
Awak kena relaks. Semuanya mengarut.

417
00:21:40,382 --> 00:21:42,843
Pergi jahanam semua ini.
Awak nak pergi minum?

418
00:21:43,928 --> 00:21:45,094
Saya?

419
00:21:45,095 --> 00:21:46,763
Ya, awak.

420
00:21:46,764 --> 00:21:49,098
Awak reti keluar bersosial, bukan?

421
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:50,768
Biasanya saya bersama Becca.

422
00:21:51,393 --> 00:21:53,937
Okey, bawa dia sekali.
Dia boleh memandu?

423
00:21:53,938 --> 00:21:56,106
Tak, dia bersama teman lelakinya.

424
00:21:57,274 --> 00:21:58,359
Okey, Becca.

425
00:22:00,402 --> 00:22:01,612
Jadi, hanya kita berdua.

426
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:05,866
Awak suka karaoke?

427
00:22:06,992 --> 00:22:08,118
Awak suka menyanyi?

428
00:22:08,828 --> 00:22:12,540
Lebih seperti terapi jeritan purba.

429
00:22:13,249 --> 00:22:16,376
Cara terbaik adalah minum dan melalak

430
00:22:16,377 --> 00:22:18,254
untuk melupakan kegilaan hari ini.

431
00:22:19,338 --> 00:22:20,840
Saya perlu malam menyeronokkan.

432
00:22:22,508 --> 00:22:24,217
Kita berdua perlukannya.

433
00:22:24,218 --> 00:22:27,595
Tiada peningkatan. Masih gunakan EEG.

434
00:22:27,596 --> 00:22:29,430
- Neurologi dipanggil.
- Okey.

435
00:22:29,431 --> 00:22:31,432
OB suruh hantar.
Mereka dah sediakan OR.

436
00:22:31,433 --> 00:22:34,227
- Sudah tiba masanya.
- Bayi makin teruk.

437
00:22:34,228 --> 00:22:36,229
Makin jadi lebih teruk.

438
00:22:36,230 --> 00:22:38,189
Eklampsia, sawan refraktori,
sindrom HELLP

439
00:22:38,190 --> 00:22:40,066
dengan anemia dan trombositopenia.

440
00:22:40,067 --> 00:22:42,068
Ya, kombinasi teruk.

441
00:22:42,069 --> 00:22:43,070
V-fib!

442
00:22:44,113 --> 00:22:47,241
Mampatan dada.
Nazely, caj hingga 200.

443
00:22:48,951 --> 00:22:51,578
Sediakan perut, ambil pemanas bayi.

444
00:22:51,579 --> 00:22:54,123
- Hubungi NICU. Mulakan pemasa.
- Dicas.

445
00:22:55,082 --> 00:22:56,166
Sedia.

446
00:22:58,168 --> 00:23:00,296
Teruskan pemampatan.
Kita akan periksa ritma.

447
00:23:02,006 --> 00:23:03,214
Pakai gaun.

448
00:23:03,215 --> 00:23:04,549
Robby, kita berdua.

449
00:23:04,550 --> 00:23:06,385
Nazely, apa peraturan empat minit?

450
00:23:06,802 --> 00:23:07,887
Tak pasti.

451
00:23:09,054 --> 00:23:10,638
Pesakit hamil, janin boleh hidup,

452
00:23:10,639 --> 00:23:13,016
ada empat minit
untuk selamatkan bayi.

453
00:23:13,017 --> 00:23:14,101
Serta ibu.

454
00:23:14,768 --> 00:23:16,769
Bukan lagi Caesarean selepas mati.

455
00:23:16,770 --> 00:23:19,439
Tapi histerotomi resusitasi
untuk selamatkan dua-dua.

456
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,149
Tapi pesakit tak mahu dibedah.

457
00:23:21,150 --> 00:23:24,068
Tak penting. Ibu dan bayi
akan mati kalau kita tak bertindak.

458
00:23:24,069 --> 00:23:25,612
Okey, cas hingga 200.

459
00:23:25,613 --> 00:23:27,907
Periksa ritma
dan kami berdua ambil alih.

460
00:23:28,949 --> 00:23:31,492
Ellis, awak dan Crus
fokus resusitasi ibu.

461
00:23:31,493 --> 00:23:33,161
Shen dan Nazely ambil bayi.

462
00:23:33,162 --> 00:23:34,371
Hentikan mampatan.

463
00:23:36,081 --> 00:23:37,249
Masih V-fib.

464
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:38,792
Mula.

465
00:23:40,002 --> 00:23:41,711
Sambung mampatan, 1 amp epi.

466
00:23:41,712 --> 00:23:42,795
Tiba masanya.

467
00:23:42,796 --> 00:23:45,466
- Kita perlu keluarkan bayi.
- Okey, ke tepi.

468
00:23:48,135 --> 00:23:49,428
Okey, bilah 10.

469
00:23:50,763 --> 00:23:53,973
Bagus. Insisi pertama dari xifoid

470
00:23:53,974 --> 00:23:55,767
kepada simfisis pubis

471
00:23:55,768 --> 00:23:58,645
melalui kulit ke linea alba.

472
00:23:58,646 --> 00:24:00,563
Unit tiga dan empat pada infuser.

473
00:24:00,564 --> 00:24:03,650
Insisi kedua melalui peritoneum,

474
00:24:03,651 --> 00:24:05,360
mendedahkan rahim.

475
00:24:05,361 --> 00:24:06,861
Saya kena buat apa?

476
00:24:06,862 --> 00:24:09,489
Bayi itu. Nazely jaga beg topeng.

477
00:24:09,490 --> 00:24:11,532
Awak buat sedutan.
Sedia untuk intubasi.

478
00:24:11,533 --> 00:24:12,659
Retraktor pundi.

479
00:24:12,660 --> 00:24:14,661
Monitor neonatal dan oksigen sedia.

480
00:24:14,662 --> 00:24:16,246
Ellis, tarikan lembut.

481
00:24:17,247 --> 00:24:20,708
Okey, buat hirisan menegak kecil
melalui rahim bawah

482
00:24:20,709 --> 00:24:22,878
supaya tak cederakan bayi.

483
00:24:24,713 --> 00:24:26,214
- Boleh?
- Ya, boleh.

484
00:24:26,215 --> 00:24:27,298
- Okey.
- Okey.

485
00:24:27,299 --> 00:24:30,427
Guna gunting memotong ke atas.

486
00:24:32,179 --> 00:24:34,389
Ellis, tarik balik rahim
bersama saya.

487
00:24:34,390 --> 00:24:36,016
Cecair amniotik kelihatan baik.

488
00:24:37,977 --> 00:24:40,688
- Beri tekanan fundus.
- Kedudukan songsang.

489
00:24:43,399 --> 00:24:45,693
Okey, bayi keluar.

490
00:24:46,694 --> 00:24:47,820
- Perempuan.
- Okey.

491
00:24:50,197 --> 00:24:51,407
Picit tali pusat.

492
00:24:53,075 --> 00:24:54,326
Kapit.

493
00:24:55,661 --> 00:24:56,704
Memotong.

494
00:24:57,579 --> 00:24:59,789
Bayi biru dan lembik.
Shen, dah sedia?

495
00:24:59,790 --> 00:25:01,542
- Dapat?
- Ya.

496
00:25:07,798 --> 00:25:09,924
Ton lemah, tiada pergerakan.

497
00:25:09,925 --> 00:25:11,552
Dekatkan <i>blow-by.</i>

498
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:13,761
Dia sangat biru.

499
00:25:13,762 --> 00:25:16,764
Sedikit biru adalah biasa,
tapi tak seperti ini.

500
00:25:16,765 --> 00:25:18,016
Perlukah intubasi?

501
00:25:18,017 --> 00:25:20,894
Belum. Biasanya bertukar
dengan rangsangan dan <i>blow-by.</i>

502
00:25:21,395 --> 00:25:23,187
Okey, buang plasenta.

503
00:25:23,188 --> 00:25:25,774
Periksa ke kiri, pastikan kaup semua.

504
00:25:27,443 --> 00:25:28,609
- Utuh.
- Ya.

505
00:25:28,610 --> 00:25:29,695
Bagus sekali.

506
00:25:30,863 --> 00:25:32,822
10 IV Pitocin untuk kecutkan rahim.

507
00:25:32,823 --> 00:25:34,241
Buat banyak urutan.

508
00:25:35,034 --> 00:25:36,743
Denyutan jantung, 76.

509
00:25:36,744 --> 00:25:39,204
Kurang 100 bermakna guna beg.
Sedut dulu.

510
00:25:42,791 --> 00:25:45,794
Jord, cas ke 200.
Sedia untuk periksa ritma lagi.

511
00:25:46,879 --> 00:25:48,629
Bayi kerut dahi. Petanda baik.

512
00:25:48,630 --> 00:25:49,714
Beg oksigen.

513
00:25:49,715 --> 00:25:51,258
Oksigen nadi, 45%.

514
00:25:51,759 --> 00:25:53,259
Tak pernah nampak serendah itu.

515
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:56,638
Tak seteruk disangka.
Saya lagi risau denyutan jantung.

516
00:25:57,097 --> 00:25:59,599
McKay, sediakan IO
sekiranya perlu epi.

517
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:00,684
Okey.

518
00:26:02,603 --> 00:26:04,146
Periksa ritma. Henti mampatan.

519
00:26:05,272 --> 00:26:06,898
Masih V-fib. Okey, renjat.

520
00:26:06,899 --> 00:26:07,983
Sedia.

521
00:26:08,609 --> 00:26:10,151
Sambung mampatan.

522
00:26:10,152 --> 00:26:13,154
- Bagaimana bayi itu?
- Jantung bayi, 104.

523
00:26:13,155 --> 00:26:15,782
Satu minit, tiada warna.

524
00:26:15,783 --> 00:26:19,078
Dua untuk jantung, satu untuk
refleks, ton, pernafasan. APGAR 5.

525
00:26:19,453 --> 00:26:20,996
5 daripada 10. Tak bagus.

526
00:26:21,455 --> 00:26:24,041
- Oksigen nadi, 58%.
- Intubasi?

527
00:26:24,541 --> 00:26:27,168
Belum, O2 dalam lingkungan 60
adalah normal.

528
00:26:27,169 --> 00:26:29,213
Denyutan jantung
dan oksigen nadi meningkat.

529
00:26:29,797 --> 00:26:32,882
Sekarang, kita teruskan rangsangan.
Berikan masa.

530
00:26:32,883 --> 00:26:33,967
Berhenti mampatan.

531
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:35,594
Macam sinus.

532
00:26:37,012 --> 00:26:38,263
Tak rasa nadi karotid.

533
00:26:39,473 --> 00:26:41,475
Jantung hampir tak mengepam. PEA.

534
00:26:41,892 --> 00:26:43,059
Sambung mampatan.

535
00:26:43,060 --> 00:26:45,937
Dua unit lagi.
Lebih darah merah dan platelet.

536
00:26:45,938 --> 00:26:47,563
Hilang darah dari rahim.

537
00:26:47,564 --> 00:26:49,108
Tolong beri semua <i>lap pad.</i>

538
00:26:56,657 --> 00:26:57,949
Ya.

539
00:26:57,950 --> 00:27:00,369
Okey. Saya hargainya, Henny.

540
00:27:01,036 --> 00:27:02,121
Letak dulu.

541
00:27:03,997 --> 00:27:06,249
- Tunggu.
- Ada masalah di sini?

542
00:27:06,250 --> 00:27:08,501
Ya, jangan pergi dulu.

543
00:27:08,502 --> 00:27:09,586
Apa?

544
00:27:10,546 --> 00:27:11,964
Seorang kena ikut saya.

545
00:27:13,882 --> 00:27:17,886
Kit rogol patut diambil
dalam tempoh 72 jam selepas diletak.

546
00:27:19,054 --> 00:27:20,764
Kit ini lebih dua minggu.

547
00:27:21,515 --> 00:27:22,558
Bukan tugas kami.

548
00:27:23,100 --> 00:27:24,559
Tugas seseorang.

549
00:27:24,560 --> 00:27:26,978
Bukan saja wanita ini diserang,

550
00:27:26,979 --> 00:27:29,522
ditambah rasa aib
semasa ambil sampel,

551
00:27:29,523 --> 00:27:32,358
tapi tiada seorang pun
dari jabatan polis

552
00:27:32,359 --> 00:27:33,776
datang ambil semuanya?

553
00:27:33,777 --> 00:27:36,320
- Tiada orang di sana peduli?
- Okey.

554
00:27:36,321 --> 00:27:38,406
Kami akan pastikan
dihantar sebagai bukti.

555
00:27:38,407 --> 00:27:39,491
Terima kasih.

556
00:27:41,785 --> 00:27:42,870
Tak susah pun.

557
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:48,249
Unit lima dan enam diberi.

558
00:27:48,250 --> 00:27:50,752
- Hampir habis.
- Hentikan mampatan.

559
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:57,842
Nampak macam sinus.
Saya rasa karotid lemah.

560
00:27:57,843 --> 00:27:59,343
Okey, ukur tekanan darah.

561
00:27:59,344 --> 00:28:01,429
Jantung makin kuat mengepam.

562
00:28:01,430 --> 00:28:04,724
- Tiada aktiviti sawan pada EEG.
- Bagus sekali.

563
00:28:04,725 --> 00:28:06,100
Sudah minit kelima.

564
00:28:06,101 --> 00:28:08,186
Kadar denyutan jantung, 132.

565
00:28:08,187 --> 00:28:10,772
Oksigen nadi, 79%. Nazely, APGAR?

566
00:28:12,733 --> 00:28:15,985
Tolak satu untuk warna,
satu untuk ton, satu untuk nafas

567
00:28:15,986 --> 00:28:17,361
dengan hipoksia, maka tujuh.

568
00:28:17,362 --> 00:28:19,739
Skor pernafasan, bukan nadi oksigen.

569
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:21,699
Saturasi 80 normal minit kelima.

570
00:28:21,700 --> 00:28:23,744
Bayi tak menangis, tiada skor.

571
00:28:28,123 --> 00:28:30,082
Sudah tambah skor kemenangan.

572
00:28:30,083 --> 00:28:31,960
APGAR 8 agak normal.

573
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:37,633
Ya Tuhan, apa saya terlepas?

574
00:28:38,467 --> 00:28:40,718
Eklampsia dengan status,
sindrom HELLP,

575
00:28:40,719 --> 00:28:43,930
serangan jantung,
histerotomi resusitasi.

576
00:28:43,931 --> 00:28:46,390
Saya di bilik bedah.
Pembedahan septik kembar.

577
00:28:46,391 --> 00:28:47,600
Dapat mesej 12 minit.

578
00:28:47,601 --> 00:28:49,018
Pantas betul di sini.

579
00:28:49,019 --> 00:28:51,687
Histerotomi resusitasi dalam 36 saat.

580
00:28:51,688 --> 00:28:54,023
- Mengagumkan.
- Tekanan darah, 102/64.

581
00:28:54,024 --> 00:28:56,109
- Hemoglobin, 9.
- Dah memadai.

582
00:28:57,236 --> 00:28:59,238
- NICU hantar pasukan.
- Boleh hantar si ibu.

583
00:28:59,613 --> 00:29:00,988
Kamu hebat.

584
00:29:00,989 --> 00:29:03,283
Kami suka digelar penjaga malam.

585
00:29:06,912 --> 00:29:09,372
Entah-entah, awak akan di sini
sepanjang malam.

586
00:29:09,373 --> 00:29:11,667
Tak, Henny akan sampai
dalam 30 minit.

587
00:29:12,125 --> 00:29:13,252
Apa khabar ibu dan bayi?

588
00:29:14,628 --> 00:29:16,004
Dibawa ke atas.

589
00:29:16,672 --> 00:29:18,673
Bagus. Awak nak balik sekarang?

590
00:29:18,674 --> 00:29:20,341
Ya, kejap lagi.

591
00:29:20,342 --> 00:29:22,469
Saya perlu cari Whitaker
dan Al-Hashimi.

592
00:29:23,971 --> 00:29:25,763
Langdon juga sebelum pergi.

593
00:29:25,764 --> 00:29:27,599
Awak terlepas Langdon.
Dia baru keluar.

594
00:29:31,561 --> 00:29:32,646
Tak guna.

595
00:29:37,192 --> 00:29:39,319
UNIT PENJAGAAN PEMBEDAHAN

596
00:29:56,503 --> 00:29:57,587
Boleh saya bantu?

597
00:29:57,838 --> 00:30:00,507
Ya, saya Dr. Langdon dari ED.

598
00:30:01,258 --> 00:30:05,929
Saya nak tahu status pesakit
yang kami hantar ke sini tadi.

599
00:30:06,805 --> 00:30:09,348
Nama pesakit ialah Cohen.

600
00:30:09,349 --> 00:30:11,768
Biar saya semak. Kes apa?

601
00:30:12,019 --> 00:30:13,562
Pembedahan fasciitis nekrotik.

602
00:30:16,898 --> 00:30:20,694
Ya, dia selamat.
Dia berada di 4202, sedang pulih.

603
00:30:21,194 --> 00:30:22,279
Baguslah.

604
00:30:22,821 --> 00:30:23,988
Baguslah.

605
00:30:23,989 --> 00:30:26,866
Keadaannya tak bagus tadi.

606
00:30:26,867 --> 00:30:28,409
Mujur awak sedar.

607
00:30:28,410 --> 00:30:30,954
Awak selamatkan dia,
walau bukan kakinya.

608
00:30:34,583 --> 00:30:35,916
Amputasi bawah lutut?

609
00:30:35,917 --> 00:30:37,544
Malangnya, di atas.

610
00:30:54,978 --> 00:30:57,688
Nombor saya dan pengurus bangunan.

611
00:30:57,689 --> 00:30:59,607
Dia boleh bantu jika ada kecemasan.

612
00:30:59,608 --> 00:31:02,902
- Ya. Kecemasan macam apa?
- Apa-apa saja.

613
00:31:02,903 --> 00:31:05,237
Buat susulan dengan Duke
dalam beberapa hari lagi.

614
00:31:05,238 --> 00:31:06,739
Ya. Awak...

615
00:31:06,740 --> 00:31:08,574
Awak pasti?

616
00:31:08,575 --> 00:31:09,743
Saya percayakan awak.

617
00:31:10,494 --> 00:31:11,578
Okey.

618
00:31:12,245 --> 00:31:13,246
Ada soalan?

619
00:31:14,247 --> 00:31:16,707
Bila awak akan kembali sebenarnya?

620
00:31:16,708 --> 00:31:19,669
Saya akan mesej awak.
Tarikhnya belum tentu.

621
00:31:21,588 --> 00:31:23,465
Rasanya orang datang jemput awak.

622
00:31:23,965 --> 00:31:28,135
Ya. Saya janji akan tengok
rumah awak esok.

623
00:31:28,136 --> 00:31:29,137
Baguslah.

624
00:31:30,847 --> 00:31:31,932
- Hei.
- Hei.

625
00:31:32,599 --> 00:31:35,185
Okey. Hei, Theo.

626
00:31:35,685 --> 00:31:37,395
Belum tidur lagi?

627
00:31:37,396 --> 00:31:38,480
Awak bawa apa?

628
00:31:41,691 --> 00:31:42,901
Okey.

629
00:31:44,152 --> 00:31:45,653
Dia meragam seharian.

630
00:31:45,654 --> 00:31:47,696
Rasanya nak tumbuh gigi lagi.

631
00:31:47,697 --> 00:31:49,615
Syabas, si comel.

632
00:31:49,616 --> 00:31:51,993
Sedia untuk <i>funky?</i>

633
00:31:53,036 --> 00:31:54,121
Ya?

634
00:32:13,807 --> 00:32:14,891
Hei.

635
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:16,935
Berjaya pilih pengkhususan?

636
00:32:18,812 --> 00:32:19,896
Saya tak tahu.

637
00:32:21,523 --> 00:32:23,608
Mungkin saya pilih geriatrik.

638
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:26,695
Pilihan bijak.

639
00:32:30,949 --> 00:32:32,575
Saya tahu hidup penuh cabaran,

640
00:32:32,576 --> 00:32:35,286
terutamanya apabila
tak jadi macam diharapkan.

641
00:32:35,287 --> 00:32:36,371
Okey.

642
00:32:41,501 --> 00:32:44,629
Ingatkan dapat kahwin,
ada anak nak masuk kolej sekarang.

643
00:32:46,256 --> 00:32:48,883
Mungkin beli rumah ada kolam

644
00:32:48,884 --> 00:32:51,136
dan kami main hoki pada musim sejuk.

645
00:32:53,346 --> 00:32:54,513
Namun, lihatlah saya.

646
00:32:54,514 --> 00:32:58,018
Tiada isteri, anak atau kolam.

647
00:33:01,980 --> 00:33:02,981
Belum terlambat.

648
00:33:04,357 --> 00:33:05,692
Awak percaya begitu?

649
00:33:06,943 --> 00:33:08,152
Ya.

650
00:33:08,153 --> 00:33:10,447
- Untuk saya atau awak juga?
- Okey.

651
00:33:11,615 --> 00:33:12,782
Saya faham.

652
00:33:14,326 --> 00:33:16,912
Luahan itu benar
atau sekadar cerita kosong?

653
00:33:23,126 --> 00:33:25,045
Masalah dengan mak awak dah selesai?

654
00:33:28,298 --> 00:33:29,382
Kami tak berhubung.

655
00:33:33,011 --> 00:33:34,846
Maaf sebab biar hal itu

656
00:33:35,847 --> 00:33:37,057
mengganggu saya.

657
00:33:38,850 --> 00:33:41,728
Dia layan saya macam budak
dan saya biarkan.

658
00:33:47,108 --> 00:33:48,109
Selamat mengembara.

659
00:33:49,736 --> 00:33:50,737
Semoga selamat.

660
00:33:52,906 --> 00:33:53,990
Kami perlukan awak.

661
00:33:55,408 --> 00:33:57,244
Walaupun kadang-kadang awak teruk.

662
00:34:00,205 --> 00:34:01,206
Semoga berjaya.

663
00:34:03,083 --> 00:34:04,167
Awak juga.

664
00:34:13,134 --> 00:34:15,469
Tak sangka awak masih ada.

665
00:34:15,470 --> 00:34:17,722
Saya baru cakap
dengan pakar neurologi.

666
00:34:19,307 --> 00:34:20,392
Jadi?

667
00:34:21,059 --> 00:34:23,353
Kami bersembang dengan baik.

668
00:34:24,437 --> 00:34:26,981
Dia setuju saya boleh bekerja
dengan bantuan.

669
00:34:26,982 --> 00:34:28,483
Bukan keputusan dia.

670
00:34:29,484 --> 00:34:30,776
Kerja kritikal tak boleh

671
00:34:30,777 --> 00:34:33,822
jika keadaan awak tak sedar lima saat
boleh membunuh pesakit.

672
00:34:35,991 --> 00:34:37,075
Saya setuju.

673
00:34:40,620 --> 00:34:43,205
Tapi 90% pesakit
tak perlukan prosedur kritikal.

674
00:34:43,206 --> 00:34:44,291
Yang perlu pula?

675
00:34:45,542 --> 00:34:47,710
Ditangani orang
yang bekerjasama dengan saya.

676
00:34:47,711 --> 00:34:49,920
Melainkan mereka
ada pesakit kritikal lain.

677
00:34:49,921 --> 00:34:52,381
- Kalau dua atau tiga orang...
- Saya boleh.

678
00:34:52,382 --> 00:34:54,425
Tak boleh. Saya tak boleh biarkan.

679
00:34:54,426 --> 00:34:57,511
- Saya mampu...
- Tak, awak tak mampu

680
00:34:57,512 --> 00:34:58,763
dan awak sedar.

681
00:35:02,809 --> 00:35:03,892
Apa awak mahu?

682
00:35:03,893 --> 00:35:06,146
Yang terbaik buat pesakit dan staf.

683
00:35:06,646 --> 00:35:08,022
Senario terbaik,

684
00:35:08,023 --> 00:35:10,524
awak dapat tanganinya,
bebas sawan selama enam bulan.

685
00:35:10,525 --> 00:35:12,860
Dapatkan lesen memandu,
baru boleh bekerja.

686
00:35:12,861 --> 00:35:14,738
Saya dibenarkan untuk dapat lesen.

687
00:35:15,447 --> 00:35:17,489
Awak tak sepatutnya memandu pun.

688
00:35:17,490 --> 00:35:19,950
Jika awak pesakit,
kami perlu laporkan.

689
00:35:19,951 --> 00:35:21,619
Saya bukan pesakit awak.

